# VCasT All Stats 0003

Same set of stats and interpolation settings as `all_stats-0002`, but the forecast side
comes from a different model's NetCDF output ("resHRRR") instead of HRRR GRIB2 -- this
exercises comparing a forecast in one file format/model against a reference (HRRR
analysis) in another.

## Command

```bash
# Computes all configured stats and writes them to stat.out
vcast stat.yaml
```
